    <mdiv type="solesmes">
      <score>
        <section>
          <pb xml:id="m-2f505b18-0e5f-4e44-9283-062d5f9ecb79" n="2072" facs="#m-426f9387-7b4c-4fdc-a70e-74af161f54f5" /><div xml:id="m-7bfdd02c-d39d-431d-8919-e18058f729ac">
            <lg xml:id="m-d41dd019-aacb-4ab5-949a-bfc8d7515624">
              <l xml:id="m-cccba100-c348-4b44-aa8a-cf6ed1e98867" facs="#m-7666f8a2-38fd-43d5-b40e-4b9baa2859fc" label="ambiguous">1826</l><l xml:id="m-38799b6f-c683-4529-ada2-403dfabd1f78" facs="#m-58ecf794-be19-4821-8fe6-cb7860a9e9b2" label="text-like">The Burial of very young Children.</l><l xml:id="m-a8102ebf-26c8-4fc4-be86-85a8d8140298" facs="#m-9c5536cc-0e51-458c-9c20-3dc87f4c6b66" label="lyrics-like">Tunc non confúndar, * cum per¬</l><l xml:id="m-ac9b8c07-d43e-4e46-8d9e-eaf45fff5614" facs="#m-7fb7bb0e-c903-42b0-9101-d3fd94bc4324" label="lyrics-like">Concupívit ánima méa desideráre</l><l xml:id="m-3b17a00e-9d58-4558-b73c-4bc9e8868ea5" facs="#m-65365cf9-d9c1-471f-aa77-846033e2f00b" label="lyrics-like">justificatiónes túas, * in ómni tém¬</l><l xml:id="m-dbc13dac-85d3-40ef-8830-e0646d7c9a43" facs="#m-7ff59430-ab12-43a4-934b-b225fd59680a" label="lyrics-like">spéxero in ómnibus mandátis túis.</l><l xml:id="m-b669a517-a975-4608-a956-92038faf8dbe" facs="#m-1b89fcda-2769-4a56-b11e-65953e05e11e" label="lyrics-like">Confitébor tibi in directióne cór¬</l><l xml:id="m-d1d55b2d-38a1-402c-bd49-5321a47d7b88" facs="#m-3cb34565-e1a0-46c6-b806-b64e2e91a59b" label="ambiguous">pore.</l><l xml:id="m-8cba2c95-b7f8-4ea9-9c7b-acbf7e35620a" facs="#m-7609d26e-ce43-4eb7-ad25-37f55f92efb0" label="lyrics-like">Increpásti supérbos :* maledicti</l><l xml:id="m-5f662f31-b2b7-4198-94f1-e3fee09b0989" facs="#m-d4b3075c-8dcf-4c8e-9c75-290f7ed8a887" label="lyrics-like">dis:* in éo quod dídici judicia ju¬</l><l xml:id="m-fb96f42c-74af-4459-866e-807257afd9f2" facs="#m-3e2c8e6e-8e79-4322-a4a1-19af4f7dedc7" label="lyrics-like">stitiae túae.</l><l xml:id="m-67a874e7-9a5c-43af-a451-88d6fe40be2f" facs="#m-e70086a0-395f-4f40-aca5-92e118cc8fa4" label="lyrics-like">qui declinant a mandátis túis.</l><l xml:id="m-572b915f-1139-40bf-9e99-21471a68bc6f" facs="#m-d9e19223-e4e2-423e-a0de-524796a096f8" label="lyrics-like">Justificatiónes túas custódiam :"</l><l xml:id="m-7c1ead6f-f1c3-4599-8fe0-76234b15e5e5" facs="#m-34c71e85-bf02-424a-b4fc-b5b8f7a3f147" label="lyrics-like">Aufer a me oppróbrium et con¬</l><l xml:id="m-a3efe820-d082-4c9c-8b24-2b45877c31ef" facs="#m-54ca02b4-5c1e-4634-bd6c-fb3514d678d6" label="lyrics-like">témptum: “ quia testimónia túa</l><l xml:id="m-6cd62247-e1b0-471b-a2b6-fbbf36c55544" facs="#m-2fcf5759-e7cb-4107-a3d1-b2af52166d33" label="lyrics-like">non me derelinquas usquequáque.</l><l xml:id="m-3ef41ac6-b3c6-4396-a707-6215aad63dbf" facs="#m-1331b9a3-bec7-4768-954f-ea59f9885b21" label="ambiguous">exquisivi.</l><l xml:id="m-9927f812-a580-4d6d-8fc8-39f7a78fefac" facs="#m-2629d9ba-d447-45e2-b986-6659a5849a4e" label="lyrics-like">In quo córrigit adotescéntior</l><l xml:id="m-323b9835-1237-4702-a910-52bba495ad5a" facs="#m-4df2fc1e-6cdc-466f-aae2-9d27528afca3" label="lyrics-like">Êtenim sedérunt principes, et ad¬</l><l xml:id="m-32f3bec3-1aeb-4ef9-8976-2086f9686236" facs="#m-93a0dd94-ac21-49ef-ab5b-ed9e975f23f9" label="lyrics-like">viam súam?*in custodiéndo ser¬</l><l xml:id="m-86fc0355-a375-4afa-b292-6a48db6d9df2" facs="#m-6ea55289-3435-4597-b3ea-26f886bd7936" label="lyrics-like">vérsum me loquebántur : * sérvus</l><l xml:id="m-8b871716-101a-42e1-8fc4-617af256aa83" facs="#m-3c7407cf-3d68-4996-bd39-d8dc82e31515" label="lyrics-like">mónes túos.</l><l xml:id="m-efa42332-7f80-434e-9dd4-57ab95933f4d" facs="#m-f93ee934-d87a-4be7-8636-062598cc97dc" label="lyrics-like">In tóto córde méo exquisívi te:"</l><l xml:id="m-b876215d-fa3e-4ebc-bb31-35ceb2d28adb" facs="#m-05742869-7860-47ee-be74-f0f9e6c7e2ee" label="lyrics-like">autem túus exercebátur in justifica¬</l><l xml:id="m-b1e73c1a-0293-42d7-8dd6-5d13a5a079dc" facs="#m-881b1492-94ec-4cf3-b4ee-09ff7384396b" label="lyrics-like">tiónibus túis.</l><l xml:id="m-5046f659-aaff-431d-8ed4-3cec64dd5a15" facs="#m-b5a4029b-c61a-41a5-9a0e-453b9e379707" label="lyrics-like">ne repéllas me a mandátis túis.</l><l xml:id="m-43aa5c2a-3007-41f8-86e7-2d5174a2c6af" facs="#m-2dc9bb21-91a3-4987-8bc0-0ced67139c9d" label="lyrics-like">Nam et testimónia túa meditátio</l><l xml:id="m-49ac0531-cdb2-4cbc-9f18-e00a4a7ddb82" facs="#m-5895701a-70db-45c7-af75-e97ab5ab9b04" label="lyrics-like">In córde méo abscóndi elóquia</l><l xml:id="m-b6446134-0d19-4441-be7e-5d4fe355cc00" facs="#m-e4b815de-bedb-4ebe-a6d3-b64559a5931e" label="lyrics-like">méa est :* et consilium méum ju¬</l><l xml:id="m-b9137ea3-5fd0-429a-8daa-a67309ef25f7" facs="#m-1abf6bb0-cd45-4463-ab58-aab42efcbdc4" label="lyrics-like">túa:*ut non péccem tíbi.</l><l xml:id="m-3c1c0bd6-15f8-4fb0-820b-0527785a078d" facs="#m-2fc5667e-b67d-4ae6-8833-4f14e635e140" label="lyrics-like">Benedictus es Dómine: “dóce</l><l xml:id="m-cf6a27af-8b67-47bd-8f84-db0b911fe5b4" facs="#m-8428c5eb-32b0-445a-aae7-6f9bcf239288" label="lyrics-like">stificatiónes túae.</l><l xml:id="m-35857bfe-345f-4f2f-a987-42780d07d277" facs="#m-351fd2ac-526f-4c24-92fc-d09c09cc7c22" label="lyrics-like">Adhaésit paviménto ánima méa:</l><l xml:id="m-984f84c5-faed-4945-81dd-44ca77c3c83e" facs="#m-d665573d-1a4e-4708-951a-aee27bdc145c" label="lyrics-like">me justificatiónes túas.</l><l xml:id="m-cb17de10-fda0-4e91-9110-98f9e79846b7" facs="#m-6004c48a-d516-4b93-8721-f989c941aab7" label="lyrics-like">In lábiis méis, pronuntiávi</l><l xml:id="m-fee0b869-977d-4270-ba74-c4008fc6d8f2" facs="#m-102b4290-c15f-4d4f-9afc-e8b530a59acf" label="lyrics-like">vivífica me secúndum vérbum túum.</l><l xml:id="m-f2ac3e3e-c24e-4237-b471-8b8f50aaf487" facs="#m-7f28acd1-2303-4e8d-8180-2c6663fd6603" label="lyrics-like">ómnia judicia óris tui¬</l><l xml:id="m-8eb53ea1-9bd4-40af-a699-6e2c0f2e5970" facs="#m-c630b0f8-d08d-4c98-81f1-1fd66707a213" label="lyrics-like">vías méas enuntiávi, et exaudisti</l><l xml:id="m-146a4ad4-00d4-4438-9436-ee6810f6173f" facs="#m-ae9e7ce3-c2c9-4973-a22f-9bff646bc7ff" label="lyrics-like">In vía testimoniórum tuórum de¬</l><l xml:id="m-dcba14b2-45d7-4698-8c6a-84ce40958156" facs="#m-60e68093-77b5-48a7-8f8b-4a54cb354c84" label="lyrics-like">me :* dóce me justificatiónes túas.</l><l xml:id="m-e2c1ef0e-026c-40ba-8912-157fc5c80978" facs="#m-86a54f2f-68eb-49df-8538-85cdfbfeaa50" label="lyrics-like">lectátus sum,*sicut in ómnibus</l><l xml:id="m-5f2082c2-4546-45ab-821a-8085dc3d2108" facs="#m-e3ea36c6-9a4c-4df5-aa0d-c2e96f585bfc" label="lyrics-like">Víam justificatiónum tuárum in¬</l><l xml:id="m-b22c8e13-a38e-4d00-8ff4-0a0055684835" facs="#m-8cca3a0c-13cd-4832-9e1e-9f9a501c6d0c" label="ambiguous">divitiis.</l><l xml:id="m-151b70ae-65ce-434b-a4ed-503a94061efd" facs="#m-b799e4e4-8bdf-4f7f-9ef3-7cdc664de865" label="lyrics-like">strue me :* et exercébor in mirabí¬</l><l xml:id="m-44cc12a9-fbeb-4101-a275-fbb9500bf10b" facs="#m-a6add988-be68-44e5-84cc-ed680f234dcc" label="lyrics-like">In mandátis tuis exercébor:“et</l><l xml:id="m-4a1315c2-86a4-44e7-8f5a-15c448384e85" facs="#m-8e1efd4c-6b09-4393-832a-dc0f7320f3e9" label="lyrics-like">libus túis.</l><l xml:id="m-70f47f4f-4309-4dc7-a9ea-d39ff7c90d78" facs="#m-4610181b-14d2-4287-b8a1-b639d6169df1" label="lyrics-like">Dormitávit ánima méa prae taé¬</l><l xml:id="m-06be764a-2e5f-4a06-8bf0-1e74c34becc4" facs="#m-4affc4c6-edec-4116-a2db-6bfe4d82b6e2" label="lyrics-like">considerábo vías túas.</l><l xml:id="m-a59f2891-0961-4258-9b73-dd028896ca72" facs="#m-798d663d-f3f3-4da5-ac73-bdfb64670f2e" label="lyrics-like">In justificatiónibus túis meditá¬</l><l xml:id="m-72ba6e40-7f49-4211-8e6f-69ebdc966f50" facs="#m-d746afd3-1021-4a70-9d23-29f63d6ba755" label="lyrics-like">dio :* confirma me in vérbis tuis.</l><l xml:id="m-beb704b2-4223-4bf0-8124-1f6081b35531" facs="#m-ddaf28ac-6166-4c96-bc04-c87f041dc4e6" label="lyrics-like">bor:* non oblivíscar sermónes túos.</l><l xml:id="m-9db345ba-0073-4f1d-bf2e-0e4d6a8e431f" facs="#m-7c29ba43-ded2-4e19-a3db-fef683626b49" label="lyrics-like">Víam iniquitátis ámove a me,</l><l xml:id="m-808ba1b9-7ff7-4218-ad77-13b701a32c41" facs="#m-c545eb03-ef6c-4f9d-ba20-c0003a134ffa" label="lyrics-like">Glória Pátri.</l><l xml:id="m-fa896f70-0eeb-4987-a5c4-2b377d75f2d9" facs="#m-dc6b20d7-7b3a-4fdd-9f7a-7e8b5dffa7d0" label="lyrics-like">et de lége túa miserére méi.</l><l xml:id="m-e519faa8-e8d7-44f4-9a5e-8d23fcddaf46" facs="#m-5dc2547f-2cfb-4808-820d-2bb5a68589cc" label="lyrics-like">Viam veritátis elégi: “ judicia</l><l xml:id="m-8e439aeb-0e48-40ee-8a24-a0a59bd89ff4" facs="#m-cdf75a3f-a18d-4647-aa8c-85593fe23a98" label="lyrics-like">DEtribue sérvo túo, vivífica me:</l><l xml:id="m-12501ceb-0e16-429a-a076-190e69b663a1" facs="#m-f9b720f6-ae7f-4254-b21d-fd3e5dafa1be" label="lyrics-like">túa non sum oblitus.</l><l xml:id="m-7fc71cfb-00bc-4850-869e-e27780396d70" facs="#m-278b592d-69e7-498a-b481-c4ab96a3a012" label="lyrics-like">1t et custódiam sermónes túos.</l><l xml:id="m-18a53f5f-8a61-4011-b566-158ab9241b97" facs="#m-d1c5f380-601e-40f4-b20c-c292ff935897" label="lyrics-like">Adhaési testimóniis túis Dómi¬</l><l xml:id="m-1e0f2431-b9ae-42c9-9aed-68ea91121922" facs="#m-6d7d5422-0e9a-4903-a9e7-ee0eab108095" label="lyrics-like">Revéla óculos méos :* et consi¬</l><l xml:id="m-c051c9f7-b7eb-44a3-8181-965f49112ce4" facs="#m-53169c54-fb9c-4cae-b961-8f90e135f585" label="lyrics-like">ne: * nóli me confúndere.</l><l xml:id="m-fac937cb-5a3e-4ea7-b4a4-234f43cc15b5" facs="#m-00f36bf2-8be6-465c-b2f3-90617035e066" label="lyrics-like">derábo mirabilia de lége túa.</l><l xml:id="m-0338f4e6-0aef-422b-93c3-8f3207760d55" facs="#m-ef4676e8-71e5-47a0-b23c-fcf9f9539b8f" label="lyrics-like">Víam mandatórum tuórum cu¬</l><l xml:id="m-e45aef0f-0f1d-4248-8b89-244eac27092e" facs="#m-6fbce330-93ef-47e6-9431-2e58ef37c119" label="lyrics-like">Incola égo sum in térra :* non</l><l xml:id="m-9fe6e38c-6502-4992-adce-3c1a7e7ef8b6" facs="#m-72e8e7a5-cce9-43f4-8a25-91de12debebf" label="lyrics-like">cúrri, * cum dilatásti cor méum.</l><l xml:id="m-658c58d8-b0d0-4d2a-9a06-f85ad77fc356" facs="#m-955dc448-6443-435c-8355-edb27136c6be" label="lyrics-like">Glória Pátri.</l><l xml:id="m-4cef546e-460b-404d-bd77-b82040b53d42" facs="#m-becdb05c-7bf0-4ca4-a5b8-f1066358f851" label="lyrics-like">abscóndas a me mandáta túa.</l><l xml:id="m-8674c3df-f9b8-4cba-8142-bc748621c406" facs="#m-9f8ffcfe-6bb5-45a7-bed8-6fdd94795a41" label="text-like">If time allows, the following Psalm may be said:</l><l xml:id="m-3629b6c8-978b-4519-9ad9-81a61ff09b33" facs="#m-d9dddaea-d9f4-48f2-b89c-a3e3b30877ab" label="lyrics-like">Laudáte Dóminum de térra,</l><l xml:id="m-df2b3a8b-6767-4dc7-b4f0-bdefaf4cddee" facs="#m-e7f7d1ab-d9b5-405d-9bef-e80a26a8ed40" label="ambiguous">Psalm 148.</l><l xml:id="m-667c5117-3430-4dd9-8ae7-7d6b64db0bd7" facs="#m-2eabe19d-6e15-4c19-bcfb-7bccc442ceb6" label="lyrics-like">dracónes, et ómnes abyssi.</l><l xml:id="m-c9c2edbb-503b-45f4-a827-6659144bc773" facs="#m-122ba81d-437e-4cf0-95d7-93741661ce05" label="lyrics-like">Audáte Dóminum de caélis:</l><l xml:id="m-61e33a13-603c-4457-8b17-160b996278f7" facs="#m-0bf42b26-3a4e-4a61-a673-dfadc1fc9bd5" label="lyrics-like">Ignis, grándo, nix, glácies, spíri¬</l><l xml:id="m-14cfea01-0689-4b08-9b9c-115fe263e9c0" facs="#m-6616adcf-28d9-49ca-893d-b63f4af1c001" label="lyrics-like">11 laudâte éum in excélsis.</l><l xml:id="m-7030ed60-df66-4d3a-8839-5ddb6e190498" facs="#m-115bcb75-9a2c-4438-95b3-0a4029bcc235" label="lyrics-like">tus procellárum: *quae fáciunt</l><l xml:id="m-99308933-5245-4a5b-845f-8b60049cc9d5" facs="#m-ee4f349f-1f7b-4aa0-a2bc-1aee6ce04df6" label="lyrics-like">Laudäte éum, ómnes Angeli</l><l xml:id="m-0a0ee3a0-b7b4-4471-830e-f6a2cfe22aaf" facs="#m-bab666a3-f355-435e-acf6-478e869611a2" label="lyrics-like">vérbum éjus:</l><l xml:id="m-c94ea84b-666b-43b8-ace3-4c2a17e80d57" facs="#m-ee37bd70-ff91-468c-92ee-f030ceb28065" label="lyrics-like">éjus: “ laudáte éum, ômnes vir¬</l><l xml:id="m-e8150639-f25b-42db-be0f-e73c9110b32f" facs="#m-aae8d45f-a0f9-4b9b-824a-df599e9c7c2e" label="lyrics-like">Móntes, et ómnes cólles : * ligna</l><l xml:id="m-9849506b-0d34-44b5-82d3-de6c83ba9e29" facs="#m-df3b7db2-81d8-492e-9ff6-610d1b128f4d" label="lyrics-like">tútes éjus.</l><l xml:id="m-6a1c2f4d-6dff-4e3f-83dc-7ce4d82a51bc" facs="#m-189d22ff-f7e3-4ade-ab58-522b2831613b" label="lyrics-like">fructifera, et ómnes cédri.</l><l xml:id="m-cc02d97f-a179-4f21-99d5-90bbb6b62eb6" facs="#m-ab60f026-ad6b-4234-866d-ebd68d1412e2" label="lyrics-like">Laudáte éum, sol et lúna: * lau¬</l><l xml:id="m-bb10c82a-8a7c-4839-990f-6b569cb34963" facs="#m-33f6ab27-31fe-46fe-ab18-f2fead8519b6" label="lyrics-like">Béstiae, et univérsa pécora:"</l><l xml:id="m-2f5dd22d-d540-419b-a8e5-0af06adabf4d" facs="#m-e6a4227e-973d-41c9-92aa-e4c845c7b078" label="lyrics-like">dáte éum ómnes stéllae et lúmen.</l><l xml:id="m-be8edb91-6710-4d84-a1dc-def0c7406d12" facs="#m-bb18de5d-ee79-453d-aeb5-2a5e302e0364" label="lyrics-like">serpéntes, et vólucres pennátae:</l><l xml:id="m-52b3b7d6-ce6f-497a-9abd-c6ae85746998" facs="#m-a3bd413e-0dec-4e03-a417-0a291a690600" label="lyrics-like">Laudáte éum, caéli caelórum:</l><l xml:id="m-4043e9b9-b923-4dcf-a6d8-293698af4d50" facs="#m-2981a2f3-ad7f-4cf9-841e-c01160845a3f" label="lyrics-like">Réges térrae, et ómnes pópu¬</l><l xml:id="m-75ae79cf-babd-41e6-849f-7b7c22134873" facs="#m-ddb2b07b-a83b-488e-a1ea-7dc5d884faf6" label="lyrics-like">et áquae ómnes, quae super caélos</l><l xml:id="m-6316f6d8-5ee2-4a61-89c9-12c4379f28b4" facs="#m-d1519125-6054-409e-83fd-6a33a1c20f13" label="lyrics-like">li : * principes, et ómnes júdices</l><l xml:id="m-ddede6a6-e0eb-4c60-abfa-2440c34df5b1" facs="#m-f17b8881-2f98-41de-9567-5bfb8c485339" label="lyrics-like">sunt, láudent nómen Dómini.</l><l xml:id="m-14c42dc9-e2e7-443d-8ea9-669eca276d17" facs="#m-7565a8e6-4f59-43f8-9ddd-2ae7b6fcd61e" label="lyrics-like">térrae.</l><l xml:id="m-55ad4661-da56-4c19-bc6e-9ba0f1f243eb" facs="#m-cd0dd8d5-fa79-4e3a-9b0a-2fdd2971f0b7" label="ambiguous">Quia ipse dixit, et facta sunt:"</l><l xml:id="m-bf728d2d-8219-4803-a637-e7f47abaf598" facs="#m-690f625f-0cce-4959-83cc-120985b05a06" label="lyrics-like">Júvenes, et vírgines:t sénes cum</l><l xml:id="m-cd1da054-5414-4c3c-9357-02d9da2467fa" facs="#m-efdc1d4a-935c-4cc8-ac92-a751bf70a918" label="lyrics-like">Ipse mandávit, et creáta sunt.</l><l xml:id="m-34151617-529b-4129-8492-ab4a777b2c1f" facs="#m-c2992799-3493-412f-8742-1e8d3d389c31" label="lyrics-like">junióribus láudent nómen Dómini:ã</l><l xml:id="m-9963a6c9-9a8a-489f-98cd-509832db960e" facs="#m-3d44fa06-9183-4525-a099-98f9bfc4ef41" label="lyrics-like">Státuit éa in aetérnum, et in saé¬</l><l xml:id="m-e14f9675-2455-4846-a583-dbf3f7fa56c7" facs="#m-54819fbe-d0e8-4303-8a4a-b698e2fbe719" label="lyrics-like">culum saéculi : * praecéptum pó¬</l><l xml:id="m-05557314-8374-4a83-b940-b6e4a5219804" facs="#m-3308a277-85dc-4ac3-99bf-caf9762d548c" label="lyrics-like">quia exaltátum est nómen éjus so¬</l><l xml:id="m-c68709cf-bab7-47c0-94a7-f0ad684c8555" facs="#m-eec9491e-60f0-42fe-81a6-d0536c08609d" label="ambiguous">suit, et non praeteribit.</l><l xml:id="m-92a6805b-1d65-414c-937e-fdddc06929ca" facs="#m-470e5ebf-98a2-4797-9cef-d49552dbefce" label="ambiguous">lius.</l></lg></div></section></score></mdiv></body></music>
</mei>